<title>USA: SOCCER-U.S. NIPS ISRAEL IN INTERNATIONAL FRIENDLY.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-U.S. NIPS ISRAEL IN INTERNATIONAL FRIENDLY.</headline>
<dateline>JACKSONVILLE, Florida 1997-06-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The U.S.</p>
<p>national soccer team beat Israel's national team 2-1 (halftime</p>
<p>1-0) in an international friendly at Alltel Stadium Tuesday.</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>USA - Alexi Lalas (28th minute), Jovan Kirovski (68th)</p>
<p>Israel - Moshe Glam (83rd)</p>
<p>Attendance: 8,436</p>
</text>
